<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore October Asian dollar assets up 5.1 pct.</title>
<headline>Singapore October Asian dollar assets up 5.1 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-12-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Asian dollar market.</p>
<p>		    (billions of U.S. dollars)</p>
<p>					  Oct 96     Sep 96   Oct 95</p>
<p>Total assets &amp; liabilities</p>
<p>of the Singapore-based</p>
<p> Asian dollar market		495.03     497.01   471.16</p>
<p>Loans to non-bank</p>
<p> customers			    175.20     175.72   167.54</p>
<p> Interbank loans		    270.17     273.78   258.32</p>
<p>The Monetary Authority of Singapore (MAS) said total assets and liabilities of the Asian dollar market rose 5.1 percent year-on-year in October.</p>
<p>-- Singapore Newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
</text>
